{"id":"d4avlgk6x90ngwbj1lq46w5ka","title":"狂犬病未来的发展与面临的挑战","originalTitle":"狂犬病未来的发展与面临的挑战（一）引言+流行病学","summary":"狂犬病是一种古老的、几乎致命的人畜共患病，主要通过犬传播给人。尽管已有多种控制工具，但全球每年仍有大量病例，尤其是贫困地区。未来的研究将聚焦于开发泛狂犬病毒属疫苗和广谱抗病毒药物，以应对不断变化的病毒种群和宿主转换。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"科学网博客"},"links":{"original":"http://blog.sciencenet.cn/home.php?mod=space&uid=347754&do=blog&id=1560218"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-08T02:01:27.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-08T07:40:19.897Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-08T07:40:19.897Z","category":"clinical","tags":["论文发表"],"score":26,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"241fe4cc-9337-41f3-bd48-731f23cbffd3","title":"科学网博客提出狂犬病疫苗与药物研发新方向"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"241fe4cc-9337-41f3-bd48-731f23cbffd3","title":"科学网博客提出狂犬病疫苗与药物研发新方向"}],"topics":[{"slug":"conference-paper","name":"顶会与论文接收"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"fGg6TxLQ_E6k","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}